    en: ["Bab El Khemis is an ancient city gate in Tlemcen that was originally part of the city walls. Today it stands as a majestic arch and a historic landmark of Moroccan-Andalusian architecture.", "Located within the People's Democratic Republic of Algeria.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region."]
